[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0010","text":"透，辛苦了！感觉很好哦！\n休息结束后，接下来要拍全员合照"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0020","text":"是——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0030","text":"很热吧\n要喝水吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0040","text":"感谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0050","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0060","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0070","text":"听到了\n刚才，咣的一声"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0080","text":"哈哈，附近有人在打棒球吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0090","text":"……嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000300_03_0100","text":"总觉得\n清澈，超级清澈"}]
